<title>DUBAI: SOCCER-RESULTS OF ASIAN CUP GROUP B MATCHES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS OF ASIAN CUP GROUP B MATCHES.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Asian Cup Group B matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Iraq 0 Saudi Arabia 1 (0-1 halftime)</p>
<p>Scorer: Fahad Mahalel 26</p>
<p>Attendance: 12,000</p>
<p> Iran   3   Thailand   1   (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Iran - Naeim Sadavi 37, Mehrdad Minavand 54, Ali Daei 70</p>
<p>Thailand - Kiatisuk Senamuang 80</p>
<p>Attendence: 3,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulated - played, won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia     2    2    0    0    7    0     6</p>
<p> Iran		 2    1    0    1    4    3     3</p>
<p> Iraq		 2    1    0    1    2    2     3</p>
<p> Thailand	   2    0    0    2    1    9     0</p>
</text>
